  m_Name: Carta_SimbioseIndustrial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Simbiose Industrial (Economia Circular)
  _titleEn: Industrial Symbiosis (Circular Economy)
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Na simbiose industrial, o res\xEDduo ou o calor que sobra de uma f\xE1brica
    vira insumo da vizinha."
  _summaryEn: In industrial symbiosis, the waste or surplus heat from one factory
    becomes input for its neighbor.
  _realWorld: "Em Kalundborg, na Dinamarca, empresas trocam vapor, \xE1gua, gesso
    e outros res\xEDduos entre si desde os anos 1970."
  _realWorldEn: In Kalundborg, Denmark, companies have exchanged steam, water, gypsum
    and other by-products since the 1970s.
  _tradeOffs: "As empresas ficam dependentes umas das outras, e a troca exige proximidade
    e confian\xE7a."
  _tradeOffsEn: Companies become dependent on each other, and the exchange requires
    proximity and trust.
  _sources:
  - Label: Kalundborg Eco-industrial Park (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalundborg_Eco-industrial_Park
  - Label: "Economia circular (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Economia_circular
